<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian stocks bounce home after weak data.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian stocks bounce home after weak data.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Stocks recovered early falls after weaker than expected September jobs data. Volume 360.6 million shares valued at A$815.5 million, 1,020 stocks traded, 327 steady, 364 rises, 324 falls</p>
</text>
